WEBVTT

00:00:05.860 --> 00:00:08.640
I can't let Usacha's efforts go to waste.

00:00:08.640 --> 00:00:12.530
There must be something I can do for NonSugar...

00:00:16.490 --> 00:00:21.500
"Traditional PriPara Gym-Sponsored Idol Deserted Island Survival-glo".

00:00:21.500 --> 00:00:29.010
"The surviving team will receive a present most wonderful and advantageous for the Divine Idol Grand Prix-glo".

00:00:29.010 --> 00:00:31.920
What the heck is this? And it's "traditional"?

00:00:32.380 --> 00:00:34.260
Hey, this looks fun!

00:00:34.260 --> 00:00:36.340
Okay, let's go for it-pri!

00:00:36.340 --> 00:00:37.220
Yes!

00:00:38.880 --> 00:00:42.680
Well, we'll leave you in the dust – you'll see!

00:00:48.840 --> 00:00:51.460
Hello, everyone!

00:00:51.460 --> 00:00:56.360
The traditional deserted island
survival challenge is about underway-glo!

00:00:56.940 --> 00:00:58.930
PriPaloha!

00:00:58.930 --> 00:01:02.620
It's a special event! PriPaloha!

00:01:03.200 --> 00:01:05.890
I didn't know there was an ocean in PriPara!

00:01:05.890 --> 00:01:06.790
Yep!

00:01:07.180 --> 00:01:13.300
Just as the flyer said, the winning team will receive a special advantage for the Grand Prix!

00:01:13.300 --> 00:01:14.560
Right here! NonSugar's entering!

00:01:14.560 --> 00:01:17.000
What are you doing? Unhand me!

00:01:17.000 --> 00:01:18.980
Deserted island? Good to eat?

00:01:18.980 --> 00:01:23.350
What are you <i>doing</i>? It's time for my flower arrangement...

00:01:47.460 --> 00:01:50.040
What?

00:03:25.820 --> 00:03:29.180
<i>It appears you've all arrived safely on your own islands.</i>

00:03:30.070 --> 00:03:35.300
<i>The PriPara Gym-sponsored deserted island survival challenge will now commence-glo!</i>

00:03:35.300 --> 00:03:36.860
Hey, there's a TV.

00:03:37.140 --> 00:03:39.900
And the game format is of course a love game!

00:03:39.900 --> 00:03:44.060
You will live on your islands,
and the last surviving team wins!

00:03:44.060 --> 00:03:45.730
We are fully prepared.

00:03:46.560 --> 00:03:47.850
All pri-pared here!

00:03:47.850 --> 00:03:49.330
Hi, Jululu!

00:03:49.830 --> 00:03:52.900
We've already obtained permission from your families-glo.

00:03:52.900 --> 00:03:55.290
This event can continue for weeks if it must-glo.

00:03:55.290 --> 00:03:57.500
Wait, seriously?

00:03:57.750 --> 00:03:59.960
No–NonSugar...

00:03:59.960 --> 00:04:02.010
Aim for the ucha-mpionship!

00:04:04.440 --> 00:04:06.940
<i>Day 1 of life on the deserted island.</i>

00:04:09.380 --> 00:04:12.140
<i>My only possession is this log.</i>

00:04:12.480 --> 00:04:18.110
<i>I have my concerns, but I want to obtain that wonderful present for NonSugar!</i>

00:04:18.110 --> 00:04:23.420
<i>I can't let Usacha's efforts be for nothing.
We three will strengthen our bonds as teammates!</i>

00:04:24.190 --> 00:04:27.750
Curse... you... Non...

00:04:29.880 --> 00:04:31.410
"Give up button"?

00:04:32.800 --> 00:04:34.570
If I were to press this...

00:04:34.570 --> 00:04:36.580
You can't!

00:04:39.210 --> 00:04:43.680
Giving up here is the same as
giving up on being Divine Idols!

00:04:43.680 --> 00:04:46.550
Besides, even if we <i>did</i> give up...

00:04:49.300 --> 00:04:52.050
Ooh! Someone dropped dumplings!

00:04:52.050 --> 00:04:52.480
It's going straight in my tummy!

00:04:52.480 --> 00:04:54.270
No, don't eat that!

00:04:57.480 --> 00:05:00.300
Garmageddon out!

00:05:00.300 --> 00:05:04.700
If you give up partway, your idol rank drops <i>all</i> the way down to Cowardly Idol!

00:05:07.410 --> 00:05:10.910
See? Our only choice is to tough it out here!

00:05:10.910 --> 00:05:12.450
So come on!

00:05:16.350 --> 00:05:17.730
It's done!

00:05:17.730 --> 00:05:19.790
Done! All done!

00:05:20.550 --> 00:05:22.210
Not half bad!

00:05:22.210 --> 00:05:23.260
Chiri, you come on, too!

00:05:23.260 --> 00:05:26.570
I decline. You may keep your slovenly abode.

00:05:26.960 --> 00:05:28.550
It shouldn't be long now.

00:05:30.400 --> 00:05:31.850
Is that the Kraken?

00:05:34.940 --> 00:05:37.760
Your household amenities, Milady.

00:05:37.760 --> 00:05:39.860
Well, better late than never.

00:05:42.140 --> 00:05:43.740
Excuse us.

00:05:50.750 --> 00:05:53.450
This should keep the wolf from the door!

00:05:59.170 --> 00:06:00.850
Here I go!

00:06:03.700 --> 00:06:07.100
What should we have for dinner?

00:06:07.100 --> 00:06:08.630
Seaweed...

00:06:09.140 --> 00:06:12.070
and these fellows, I suppose?

00:06:17.070 --> 00:06:20.270
There! Good to eat! And this!

00:06:22.800 --> 00:06:24.490
Mm, so tasty!

00:06:24.490 --> 00:06:26.740
Chiri, you have some, too!

00:06:28.530 --> 00:06:33.660
Tonight, <i>I</i> will partake of this fine hotel's Salisbury steak demi-glace and gratin!

00:06:35.400 --> 00:06:37.870
It's cold!

00:06:38.640 --> 00:06:41.170
There's nowhere to plug it in!

00:06:41.170 --> 00:06:42.920
There wouldn't be, no...

00:06:52.020 --> 00:06:54.610
I'm famished...

00:06:55.510 --> 00:06:58.100
<i>Day 2 of life on the deserted island.</i>

00:06:59.020 --> 00:07:01.060
An incident occurred.

00:07:04.780 --> 00:07:08.020
They've brought me some electricity this time, I see!

00:07:13.160 --> 00:07:16.870
Confiscated!

00:07:20.880 --> 00:07:23.500
No, the principal's hair lock!

00:07:27.800 --> 00:07:29.260
And there they go.

00:07:31.030 --> 00:07:33.800
How will I survive now...?

00:07:33.800 --> 00:07:35.220
Keep it together, Chiri!

00:07:35.220 --> 00:07:39.730
Usacha said it before, didn't she?
You're even stronger than Pepper!

00:07:40.840 --> 00:07:44.640
<i>Chiri is paper-ucha. She's actually stronger than Pepper-ucha!</i>

00:07:44.640 --> 00:07:48.110
<i>She can envelop and protect Pepper-ucha!</i>

00:07:48.520 --> 00:07:52.620
So if you two become closer, I know we can do this! Okay?

00:07:52.620 --> 00:07:54.170
Licky-stick!

00:07:55.320 --> 00:07:59.330
Chiri-shan, chiri-shan, chiri-shan-shan!
Licky-stick!

00:08:00.160 --> 00:08:04.540
<i>Day 5. The other teams seem to be giving up one by one.</i>

00:08:08.000 --> 00:08:08.660
Help me... please help me...

00:08:08.660 --> 00:08:10.990
<i>Chiri is on her last legs, too.</i>

00:08:10.990 --> 00:08:11.470
Help me... please help me...

00:08:11.470 --> 00:08:13.930
<i>As for Pepper...</i>

00:08:15.900 --> 00:08:18.700
<i>She's regressed to an animal and forgotten human speech.</i>

00:08:18.700 --> 00:08:20.890
Keep away from me, I say!

00:08:23.430 --> 00:08:25.980
But I'm not giving in.

00:08:26.810 --> 00:08:28.070
Divine Idol
Aiming for
NonSugar<i><b>!</b></i>

00:08:28.070 --> 00:08:30.280
I'll aim to be a Divine Idol!

00:08:32.240 --> 00:08:35.300
When will I again taste proper nourishment?

00:08:38.800 --> 00:08:40.700
It's Challenge Time!

00:08:43.910 --> 00:08:46.660
Return my serve!

00:08:46.660 --> 00:08:50.130
If you return just one serve, you will be gifted rice balls-glo!

00:08:57.860 --> 00:09:00.510
This is simply impossible!

00:09:00.830 --> 00:09:04.190
You just wait, Chiri! I'll get you those rice balls!

00:09:08.360 --> 00:09:09.730
Love-fifteen!

00:09:12.660 --> 00:09:14.240
Love-thirty!

00:09:15.220 --> 00:09:16.780
You can do it-ucha!

00:09:16.780 --> 00:09:19.200
Oh, how I wish I could help you-ucha!

00:09:22.350 --> 00:09:23.870
You too, Janice-ucha?

00:09:25.100 --> 00:09:28.830
Don't mind me. Continue observing them.

00:09:28.830 --> 00:09:29.810
What?

00:09:32.500 --> 00:09:34.260
I can't do this...

00:09:35.820 --> 00:09:38.220
Three teams remain!

00:09:39.510 --> 00:09:41.810
No, I can't let the others beat me!

00:09:42.110 --> 00:09:43.770
Match point!

00:09:49.790 --> 00:09:51.690
You've cleared it-glo!

00:09:51.990 --> 00:09:54.720
Here you go, Chiri!

00:09:54.720 --> 00:09:58.010
I can't eat food someone else has handled!

00:09:58.010 --> 00:09:59.660
What?

00:10:04.040 --> 00:10:23.600
Ouch!

00:10:25.600 --> 00:10:27.060
Pepper!

00:10:32.170 --> 00:10:34.610
I've got a split end!

00:10:34.610 --> 00:10:36.280
Chiri-shan, chiri-shan, conditioner!

00:10:37.030 --> 00:10:38.780
Chiri-shan, chiri-shan, chiri-shan-shan!

00:10:56.830 --> 00:10:59.130
Ugh, I'm finally done.

00:11:02.000 --> 00:11:04.600
But I spent four <i>hours</i> filling them!

00:11:10.480 --> 00:11:13.440
What's that weird noise?

00:11:17.400 --> 00:11:19.400
I... I can't sleep...

00:11:27.600 --> 00:11:29.660
We're at day 10...

00:11:32.340 --> 00:11:35.450
I wonder how Onee-chan's doing...

00:11:37.230 --> 00:11:39.980
I want to see Mum and Dad...

00:11:41.290 --> 00:11:41.680
Chiri-shan, chiri-shan, chiri-shan-shan!

00:11:41.680 --> 00:11:43.090
What's wrong?

00:11:43.090 --> 00:11:45.410
I'm out of chiri-shan water!

00:11:45.410 --> 00:11:48.260
I feel <i>hideous</i>...
What, you're still on about that?

00:11:48.260 --> 00:11:50.430
Of course I am! This is no laughing matter!

00:11:51.390 --> 00:11:52.470
I'll have to use this water!

00:11:52.470 --> 00:11:55.230
Hey, no! That's our precious drinking water!

00:11:55.230 --> 00:11:56.780
Licky-stick!

00:11:56.780 --> 00:11:58.940
No! Cease your licky-sticking, damn it!

00:12:05.110 --> 00:12:06.490
... That's it.

00:12:09.080 --> 00:12:10.830
I give up.

00:12:11.440 --> 00:12:14.430
And I'm giving up aiming to be Divine Idols, too.

00:12:15.080 --> 00:12:29.600
NonSugar is disbanded!

00:12:31.830 --> 00:12:32.560
Wa–

00:12:32.860 --> 00:12:34.400
Wait!

00:12:34.400 --> 00:12:36.370
This was for the better.

00:12:36.370 --> 00:12:41.250
My esteemed self would never suit a team with a commoner and a beast.

00:12:41.250 --> 00:12:44.530
It was folly for this team to ever form.

00:12:45.080 --> 00:12:49.210
And now that's settled, I'll find that give up button...

00:12:49.210 --> 00:12:50.180
No!

00:12:50.950 --> 00:12:54.370
What now? Non just said we were disbanded, did she not?

00:12:54.370 --> 00:12:56.100
Non lie!

00:12:57.000 --> 00:12:58.340
Not want to disband!

00:13:14.410 --> 00:13:16.140
It's impossible.

00:13:18.540 --> 00:13:20.710
My PriPara self...

00:13:21.660 --> 00:13:24.450
could never form a team with someone else.

00:13:27.120 --> 00:13:30.410
For that matter – you hate me, do you not?

00:13:31.860 --> 00:13:34.620
Me like! Like Chiri in PriPara!

00:13:35.550 --> 00:13:37.990
Behind, look like peacock.

00:13:38.660 --> 00:13:42.050
But pretty feathers, all closed.

00:13:42.830 --> 00:13:44.860
My fault?

00:13:44.860 --> 00:13:48.140
Chiri hate me. Say dirty.

00:13:48.720 --> 00:13:50.510
But me like you!

00:13:51.670 --> 00:13:53.060
Pepper...

00:14:05.610 --> 00:14:11.620
Non?

00:14:12.020 --> 00:14:14.450
Somebody!

00:14:15.580 --> 00:14:17.500
Help me!

00:14:19.500 --> 00:14:20.860
What was that?

00:14:20.860 --> 00:14:23.090
Took Non!

00:14:23.090 --> 00:14:24.890
That thing...

00:14:24.890 --> 00:14:26.970
Monster!

00:14:26.970 --> 00:14:28.100
A monster?

00:14:28.100 --> 00:14:32.720
If see monster, eyes close! Body become dust!

00:14:32.720 --> 00:14:35.430
You can't be... but then, Non...

00:14:35.780 --> 00:14:40.090
Me scared! Help...

00:14:40.090 --> 00:14:43.050
I can hardly believe Pepper's this petrified.

00:14:43.050 --> 00:14:46.650
Then what do you imagine I can do?

00:14:46.650 --> 00:14:47.860
Of course it's...

00:14:48.680 --> 00:14:50.820
<i>Chiri, you're actually really strong!</i>

00:14:51.840 --> 00:14:55.570
<i>She'll be able to envelop Pepper-ucha!</i>

00:15:00.540 --> 00:15:04.040
Remember the feelings I saw in the flowers that day...

00:15:06.140 --> 00:15:08.010
and step forward.

00:15:10.580 --> 00:15:12.470
Chiri!

00:15:20.700 --> 00:15:22.900
I am... strong.

00:15:23.670 --> 00:15:25.810
I have... strength.

00:15:37.750 --> 00:15:38.910
Chiri!

00:15:42.440 --> 00:15:44.660
Pepper, be at ease.

00:15:44.660 --> 00:15:46.380
I shall protect you!

00:15:49.510 --> 00:15:51.910
Prostrate yourself and capisce!

00:15:52.590 --> 00:15:55.180
Capisce-Da Vinci-Warhol!

00:15:55.180 --> 00:15:57.090
Ponkan goes ever against the raised floor granary!

00:15:57.090 --> 00:16:00.890
A moth in the Haniwa is worth two in the flame!
You'll need that torch in the dark pyrami-thecanthropus!

00:16:00.890 --> 00:16:02.600
Ajimi tsaichangensis-Da Vinci!

00:16:05.060 --> 00:16:06.840
Till the Lascaux drop!

00:16:07.400 --> 00:16:10.990
Ajimi-sensei says she's holed herself up in this cave to work on a mural.

00:16:10.990 --> 00:16:15.030
And she kidnapped me because she didn't want anyone to see.

00:16:15.030 --> 00:16:18.950
My Neander-pologies for surprising you!
No harm int-Indus River!

00:16:18.950 --> 00:16:21.400
Here, have her ba-chiosaurus.

00:16:21.400 --> 00:16:23.190
Of course, at no cos-tralopithecus!

00:16:23.190 --> 00:16:25.310
I don't understand a word she's saying.

00:16:25.790 --> 00:16:29.130
Don't say, "me so sad", say "Mesopotamia!"

00:16:29.130 --> 00:16:32.170
Mesopotamia!

00:16:34.430 --> 00:16:37.320
How fortunate it turned out not to be a monster.

00:16:37.320 --> 00:16:39.560
Although you could say it was worse, in its own way.

00:16:39.560 --> 00:16:44.440
Such fearsome creature...
not found in Sapanna! Never see before!

00:16:44.700 --> 00:16:48.720
I'm sorry about before.
Suddenly disbanding the team, I mean.

00:16:48.720 --> 00:16:52.640
And you came to save me anyway. Thank you.

00:16:52.640 --> 00:16:54.860
It–It's not as though I particularly...

00:16:55.790 --> 00:16:57.400
Chiri helped me too!

00:16:57.400 --> 00:17:00.160
Enveloped me! And Non!

00:17:00.520 --> 00:17:02.100
I'm cancelling that disbandment!

00:17:02.100 --> 00:17:02.960
Yep!

00:17:03.510 --> 00:17:04.830
Licky-stick for thank you!

00:17:20.660 --> 00:17:22.520
Oh, why not?

00:17:22.520 --> 00:17:24.520
And a licky-stick for you too! Here you go!

00:17:24.520 --> 00:17:26.400
Yay, licky-stick!

00:17:26.400 --> 00:17:28.020
Chiri's snapped!

00:17:28.020 --> 00:17:29.690
Congratulations!

00:17:31.310 --> 00:17:34.060
NonSugar is our winning team!

00:17:34.060 --> 00:17:34.740
Huh?

00:17:34.740 --> 00:17:36.920
Exhausted capisce...

00:17:36.920 --> 00:17:38.340
I'm both dead and alive.

00:17:38.340 --> 00:17:40.040
I can't take this anymore.

00:17:40.040 --> 00:17:42.040
Stupid Glo-chan.

00:17:42.040 --> 00:17:43.660
I'm sh–shaking...

00:17:43.660 --> 00:17:46.110
So heavy...  pushu...

00:17:47.210 --> 00:17:49.600
That was a nice full-set game, girls!

00:17:49.600 --> 00:17:51.420
You pulled though-ucha!

00:17:51.680 --> 00:17:53.130
I've revised my opinion on you.

00:17:53.880 --> 00:17:55.550
A perfect score-glo!

00:17:55.860 --> 00:17:57.290
Woo-hoo!
We did it!

00:17:57.290 --> 00:17:58.250
We did it!

00:18:00.550 --> 00:18:03.810
And what's that present for the Grand Prix?

00:18:05.590 --> 00:18:08.230
It's the smiles you're wearing right now-glo!

00:18:09.070 --> 00:18:12.540
You complemented one another's strong points and weak points.

00:18:12.540 --> 00:18:17.750
Your companionship was admirable –
truly rock, paper and scissors at once-glo!

00:18:18.660 --> 00:18:20.530
And don't worry!

00:18:20.530 --> 00:18:27.160
We also manipulated time with Hologrammation:
you only spent the weekend, one night and two days!

00:18:37.550 --> 00:18:40.590
Scan the appropriate number of MyTickets for your coord.

00:18:40.590 --> 00:18:43.510
You can also scan each other's Friend Tickets.

00:18:44.220 --> 00:18:47.020
Starting the Coord Change.

00:18:48.460 --> 00:18:53.860
Their matching polka dot-patterned coords have been arranged in three varieties: Lovely, Natural and Celeb!

00:18:53.860 --> 00:18:55.940
NonSugar Coord!

00:18:55.940 --> 00:18:56.600
Non!

00:18:56.600 --> 00:18:57.080
Chiri!

00:18:57.080 --> 00:18:58.110
Pepper!

00:18:58.950 --> 00:19:02.280
You there, prostrate yourselves and capisce!

00:19:02.280 --> 00:19:07.250
We've returned from our ordeal on the deserted island!

00:19:07.250 --> 00:19:09.980
Licky-stick for everyone! We're all idols!

00:19:09.980 --> 00:19:11.500
Ooh-ooh!

00:19:11.500 --> 00:19:13.960
We're NonSugar!

00:19:14.400 --> 00:19:15.360
Chiri-chan, you're so cute!

00:19:15.360 --> 00:19:16.850
Every family needs a Pepper!

00:19:16.850 --> 00:19:18.420
NonSugar, no life!

00:20:01.800 --> 00:20:05.100
Making Drama, switch on!

00:20:10.830 --> 00:20:11.230
Roar!

00:20:12.300 --> 00:20:13.970
Yahoo!

00:20:17.720 --> 00:20:19.230
One, two...

00:20:19.230 --> 00:20:21.360
Zoo zoo town...

00:20:21.360 --> 00:20:24.270
carnival!

00:20:25.520 --> 00:20:28.160
Cyalume Change!

00:20:33.830 --> 00:20:34.120
Non!

00:20:34.120 --> 00:20:34.460
Chiri!

00:20:34.460 --> 00:20:35.470
Pepper!

00:20:51.600 --> 00:20:54.460
Here we go!

00:20:55.270 --> 00:20:57.730
Now, to the Divine Idol stage!

00:20:57.730 --> 00:21:01.320
Divine Idol Challenge, switch on!

00:21:03.150 --> 00:21:06.450
Divine Jewel, Cyalume Jewel Mic!

00:21:06.450 --> 00:21:10.770
Let the challenge commence...
to become a Divine Idol!

00:21:29.010 --> 00:21:32.600
The closet's doors open for you...

00:21:32.600 --> 00:21:35.510
Within is a coord fit for a Divine Idol!

00:21:43.040 --> 00:21:44.680
Way to go!

00:21:44.680 --> 00:21:46.270
Ooh-ooh!

00:21:52.070 --> 00:21:53.540
Ooh-ooh!

00:21:53.540 --> 00:21:56.060
Oh blessed day-ucha!

00:21:56.060 --> 00:21:59.250
Now you can compete in the Divine Idol Grand Prix-ucha!

00:21:59.560 --> 00:22:01.990
Don't get complacent.

00:22:01.990 --> 00:22:04.840
There's no meaning unless we win.

00:22:04.840 --> 00:22:07.720
So I'll be instructing you strictly.

00:22:09.040 --> 00:22:10.930
Capisce-tulations!

00:22:11.430 --> 00:22:13.260
<i>Everything is in its place.</i>

00:22:13.260 --> 00:22:16.330
<i>Now I must simply take the baton from Onee-sama.</i>

00:23:50.950 --> 00:23:54.000
Hey, no wa! Jululu became all bigger again!

00:23:54.000 --> 00:23:57.600
I'm so happy to see you, Mama!
There's so much we can talk about!

00:23:57.600 --> 00:23:59.850
Right! But why'd you turn back all of a sudden?

00:23:59.850 --> 00:24:02.140
Onee-sama! You're acting on a whim again!

00:24:02.140 --> 00:24:04.820
Say, Janice, you've grown up as well!

00:24:04.820 --> 00:24:07.090
We'll discuss this properly today.

00:24:07.090 --> 00:24:09.460
And determine which of us is fit to be the true goddess!

00:24:09.980 --> 00:24:10.760
That sounds fine.

00:24:10.760 --> 00:24:14.210
Hey, hold on, you two! You shouldn't fight!

00:24:14.210 --> 00:24:16.760
Next time, <i>Jewlie and Janice</i>!

00:24:16.760 --> 00:24:19.770
Aim to be a Divine Idol! Let's go, PriPara!
